+# Andrew Portfolio, Batch 2B Desktop Correction
+
+This package corrects the visible desktop failures reported after Batch 2.
+
+## Installation
+
+1. Copy the package contents into the existing repository root.
+2. Replace matching HTML, JavaScript, and stylesheet files.
+3. Merge the `assets` directory. Do not delete existing media or project assets.
+4. Open `index.html`, `projects.html`, and `services.html` in the browser before committing.
+
+## Suggested commit
+
+`Correct desktop composition after Batch 2 visual review`
+
+See `_docs/BATCH-2B-QA-REPORT.md` for validation and deferred work.
